SDOS course image

This BeagleBone AI-64 image is the pinned BeagleBoard Debian image plus the
course additions listed in /etc/sdos-release and the image manifest:

  /usr/local/bin/dspctl          control the DSPs (dspctl --help)
  /usr/lib/firmware/sdos/        course firmware for each DSP and runtime

Example, as root:

  dspctl list
  dspctl stop c66x_0
  dspctl load c66x_0 /usr/lib/firmware/sdos/c66x_0-freertos.xe66
  dspctl start c66x_0
  dspctl echo c66x_0 hello

Source, documentation, and the recipe that built this image:
https://github.com/Dimitrije7/sdos2026
